From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Wed, 26 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: pay and check LP costs from team LP

Two stock sites read or wrote player[playerid].lp directly. They now use lp_ref(playerid).
Sites changed: field::check_lp_cost (1 site, the final LP compare) and PayLPCost step 1 (1 site, the LP subtraction).
With 2 duelists lp_ref(p) is player[p].lp, so the result is the same.
In Tag this makes the LP cost check and payment use the team LP, which closes the T5A handoff.
The Domain patch text is not changed here. A later build step puts the stock text back before the Domain patch runs.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UrYy4jjEcbJHKdcVYasfdb
---
 field.cpp      | 2 +-
 operations.cpp | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/field.cpp b/field.cpp
index 778f14e..f0cee31 100644
--- a/field.cpp
+++ b/field.cpp
@@ -2856,7 +2856,7 @@ int32_t field::check_lp_cost(uint8_t playerid, uint32_t lp) {
 	if(effect_replace_check(EFFECT_LPCOST_REPLACE, e))
 		return TRUE;
 	//cost[playerid].amount += val;
-	if(val <= player[playerid].lp)
+	if(val <= lp_ref(playerid))
 		return TRUE;
 	return FALSE;
 }
diff --git a/operations.cpp b/operations.cpp
index b3480f7..1abcff4 100644
--- a/operations.cpp
+++ b/operations.cpp
@@ -812,7 +812,7 @@ bool field::process(Processors::PayLPCost& arg) {
 	case 1: {
 		effect* peffect = core.select_effects[returns.at<int32_t>(0)];
 		if(!peffect) {
-			player[playerid].lp -= cost;
+			lp_ref(playerid) -= cost;
 			auto message = pduel->new_message(MSG_PAY_LPCOST);
 			message->write<uint8_t>(playerid);
 			message->write<uint32_t>(cost);
